2319 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Impressions \057 0bservations\072\n\natmosphere\072\nlocal\054 everyone knows each other\nfeeling of familiarity \222 waitress drinks coffee and chats with costumers\nfeels like its about chatting\054 relaxing \055\076 not the food \057 beverages primarily\nher daughter came by\n\ninterior\072 \nwild furniture mix \050different chairs\054 tables\051\nlot of objects \050books\054 games\054 decoration\051 \nnotes \057post\055its all around the cafe \222 many say \034reserve \050name\051\035 \ncola bottles of all flavours \nentry \222 small fountain\073 board saying \036only happiness\034 \ninside really nice plants\054 garden things\054 tree light with monkey\054 direction indicator next to it\073 chuck board \050happiness at work\054 we have the power to change\054 super man\054 \056\056\056\nto me little kitschy\nseems really homy\054 private\054 intimate\n \140phone chargers next to us\n pile of boardgames\054 music figures\054 plush toys\054 christmas decoration\054 stickers of garden gnomes\054 Garland with hedgehogs\054 alcohol bottles as candle holders\nbeer board \057sign\072 all ways go to rum\n\034\300 Pas de sous\055sous Pas de glou\055glou\035\n Music playing on a speaker\054 the music is from Pop of 20\031s \nelements from different cultures\072 mexican sombrero\054 buddhist flags\054 dream\055catcher\nred is the artistic direction\n\ncustomers\072\ncustomers dont look chic\054 \nworkers\054 young and old people\nall seem to be regularly coming\nA customer enters the caf\351  \222 wipes their shoes on both doormats \023 unusual\073 you\031d normally do that at home \0502 doormats \023 2 customers with that habit\051 \ntwo customers with dogs\054 one called Mishka \n\nwhat stands out\072\nbook\072 collects notes of visitors \050showing what the like and appreicate about the place and the owner Sonia\051\nphoto back with memories from the place\054 public fests celebrated their such as Halloween\054 Christmas\054 Easter\054 Sant Patrics Day\n)
     /K [ 350 ]
     /P 2320 0 R
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

