2323 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Impressions \057 0bservations \057 Interview\072\n\nSpace \057 Interior\072\nshowcase of all baked pastries \046 breads directly next to the entry door \050placed in a glass cabinet\051\nmore specious than the first caf\351 \050two rooms for customers to sit\051\nno outside place \nsoft\054 instrumental music\054 jazz playing\nminimal\054 clean\054 but warm atmosphere\nmultiple people working at the same time \050one in the front \057 entry area\054 1\0552 in the back kitchen\051 \222 they communicate via WalkieTalkie\nprices are more or less same as the first place\077\nfurniture all the same look \050wood\051\054 tiles\054 white walls\nbacking room \053 kitchen\nneighbourhood\072 village\055like\054 put together\054 schools\054 families \nsounds of refrigerator \050loud\054 harsh\051\nhome pasteries\054 bread\nnew owners\054 just taken over the place from a couple\n\n\nCustomers\072\nmix of ages \050still we seemed to be the youngest\051\nsome are just buying things and leave directly\054 others sit at the tables and order from there\npeople don\031t seem to stay long \050max 30 min\077\051\ncustomers stay among themselfs\054 no interaction with people on other tables\nmore distance between waitress and customers \055\076 friendly\054 warm\054 but professional \050no names are mentioned\054 no personal greetings\051)
     /K [ 352 ]
     /P 2324 0 R
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
