2785 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Object\072 Cardboard Wheel\nPerson\072 Leony\nSpeciality\072 Creative unblocking \057 shared authorship\n\nThat ridiculous cardboard wheel\077\041 Maria and I made that\056\nI\031m Leony\056 I write\056 Or at least\054 I try to\056\n\nOne afternoon\054 I told Maria I was stuck\054 completely empty\056 She handed me a  coffee and said\054 \034Then let chance decide\056\035 \n\nSo she drew a wheel\072  \034Write about a stranger\056\035 \034Kill your main character\056\035 \034Start with the ending\056\035\n\nThe joke was\054 the arrow doesn\031t move\024the wheel does\056 Maria said that\031s more honest\056 You\031re the one spinning\054 not fate\056\n\nI\031ve written three stories here because of that thing\056 None of them perfect\056 But alive\056\n\nMaria keeps it on the shelf like it\031s something important\056\nMaybe it is\056 It reminds me that being stuck is just part of the turning\056)
     /K [ 583 ]
     /P 2786 0 R
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2786 0 obj
  << /K [ 2785 0 R ]
     /P 3831 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2787 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Object\072 Green Mug\057Glas\nCustomer\072 Paul\050Speciality\072 Community forming between strangers\n\nEvery year on Saint Patrick\047s Day\054 Maria does something ridiculous\056 She turns perfectly normal drinks green\056\nGreen coffee\056 Green hot chocolate\056 Green lemonade\056 One year she even made green milk foam\056\n\nThe first time I saw it\054 I told her it looked suspiciously like a science experiment\056 She handed me this glass and said\054 \042Paul\054 now you\047re my test subject\056\042\n\nI ended up staying most of the afternoon\056 People kept comparing drinks\054 arguing about taste like it mattered\056 You\047d start talking to the person next to you without even noticing\056\nAt some point\054 the tables just shifted\056 People moved around\054 pulled chairs closer\056 The two older ladies from the back corner were teaching a card game to some students\056 Someone started singing\024badly\056 Someone else insisted they knew the lyrics\056\n\nI still don\047t know if any of those drinks were actually good\056\nBut we\047ve done it every year since\056 And somehow\054 that\047s become the tradition\056)
     /K [ 584 ]
     /P 2788 0 R
     /Pg 1630 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

