  << /ActualText (Object\072 Toy Sheep\nCustomer\072 Nina\050Speciality\072 Growing up with the place \057 continuity over years\n\nI left that sheep here by accident\056\nAt least\054 that\047s what I told Maria\056\nTruth is\054 I was 7 years old and didn\047t want to go to school\056 Every morning I cried\054 and every morning my mother brought me here first for hot chocolate\056\n\nI carried this sheep everywhere\056 One day I forgot it on a chair\056\nWhen we came back after school\054 Maria had placed it on the counter with a tiny paper coffee cup beside it\056\nShe said\054 \042He stayed for lunch\056\042\n\nI laughed so hard I nearly fell over\056\nFor years\054 whenever I visited\054 she\047d ask how the sheep was doing\056\nNow I\047m 17\056\nMy mother doesn\047t bring me anymore\056\nBut sometimes I still stop by\056\nThe sheep stays here now\056\nSomeone has to keep Maria company\056)
