2791 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Object\072 Croissant Plate\nCustomer\072 Louise\nSpeciality\072 Quiet care \057 holding space without asking\n\nThis white plate on the shelf\054 that\031s ours\056 Mine and Lotte\031s\056\nEvery morning\054 eight o\031clock\054 back corner\056 Two coffees\054 two croissants\056 And  yeah\054 we always order the second coffee before we finish the first\056 Maria still  pretends to be surprised\056\n\nOnce\054 Lotte didn\031t show up\056 No message\054 no call\056 I sat there alone\054 staring  at the empty chair\054 feeling\046 wrong\056 Like the room had lost its balance\056\nMaria didn\031t ask questions\056 She just placed a second croissant on the table\056 \034In case she\031s late\054\035 she said\056\n\nLotte came in twenty minutes later\054 completely out of breath\056 Bus trouble\056 Nothing dramatic\056 But we both laughed like it had been\056\n\nAfter that\054 Maria started using this plate for us\056 Always the same one\056 Says it helps her keep the mornings \034in order\056\035\nI think it\031s more than that\056\n\nShorter End\072\nNext day\054 same table\054 same plate\056\nShe\031s used that one for us ever since\056)
