  << /ActualText (Object\072 Coca\055Cola Bottle\nCustomer\072 Mike\nSpeciality\072 Speical orders\054 remembering\054 no rush\n\nI\031m not really a caf\351 person\056 Never was\056\nWe started coming because of the construction site down the street\056 Too cold outside\054 too noisy\054 nowhere to sit\056 Someone said this place didn\031t mind work boots\056\n\nFirst day\054 I just ordered a Coke\056 Didn\031t even look at the menu\056\nMaria put the bottle down and said\054 \034You\031ll want a glass\056\035 I told her I wouldn\031t\056 She brought one anyway\056\n\nMy colleagues and I kept coming back every lunch break\056 At some point\054 Maria stopped asking what we wanted\056 Just lined things up before we even sat down\056\nOne afternoon\054 we finished a job early and stayed longer than usual\056 No rush to get back\056 Just talking\056\nI left the empty bottle behind without thinking\056\nNext time I came in\054 it was on the shelf\056\nShe nodded at it and said\054 \034So I remember your first order\056\035\nI still get the same thing\056\n)
