  << /ActualText (\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nName\072 Maria\047s\054 Since 2018 \174 Maria\047s \046 Co\056 \174 At Maria\047s\n\nTimespan\072 Caf\351 opens\072 Autumn 2018 \267 Story ends\072 Autumn 2026 \267 8 years\n\nPlayer Role\072 A stranger who wanders in from the rain for the first time\073 breaks an object by accident\056 Repairing it piece by piece\054 allows to move through the caf\351\047s history\054 and to discover what is about to be lost\056\n\nPuzzle Structure\072 6 pieces\054 each placed moves time \n\nClosing Hints\072 appear only in present\055day scenes\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 1 \024 Outside the Caf\351 \050Autumn 2026\054 present day\n\nWhat the player sees\072 The Caf\351 from outside with the Name \034Maria\031s \056\056\056 \034\056 Rain\056 Warm light glows from inside through the window\056 The door has a sign\072 Come In \050highlighted via outdoor lamp\051\nPlayer action\072 Tap \057 click on the door\056\nWhat happens\072 Door swings open \050with a soft bell\051\056 Warm light and Caf\351 ambience spills out\056 Transition to Scene 2\056\nAudio\072 Rain\054 distant street \050\222 bell\051 \222 muffled caf\351 warmth\056\nClosing hint\072 A poster taped to the window glass\056 Through the rain it is completely unreadable\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 2 \024 At the Table\nAutumn 2026\054 present day\n\nWhat the player sees\072 Point\055of\055view from a seat at a table\056 A cup of coffee in front of the player \050steam rising\051 A menu lies on the table beside it and a figure sits at the edge\056 The shelves are filled with objects\056 \nPlayer action\072 Tap \057 click the cup\056\nWhat happens\072 Cub lifts\054 sip\054 cup moves back down toward the table \222 It nudges the small ceramic figure which breaks \222 time element \050calendar\057clock\057\056\056\056 begins turning back \056\056\056 2026\054 2025\054 2024\054 2023\054 2022\054 2021\054 2020\054 2019\054 2018 \222 Simultaneously the shelves empty\054 objects disappear one by one\054 decorations fade \222 one piece lands on the table\054 at the exact moment the time element lands on autumn 2018\nAudio\072 Cup lifts \222 sip \222 the slow knock of ceramic on ceramic \222 during the fall\072 a low hum as time rewinds\054 caf\351 sounds fading \222 crack of the figurine on the table\056\nClosing hint\072 On the menu\054 2\0553 item are crossed out \050Subtle\054 easy to miss\056\051\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 3 \024 Puzzle Piece 1\nSpring 2019\n\nWhat the player sees\072 Transparent version of the figure\056 One shard is clearly visible on the table\056 Five others are hidden\056\nPlayer action\072 Drag the shard to its correct position in the transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 Shard clicks into place\056 Calendar advances to Spring 2019\056 2 objects appear on the shelf\072 the toy sheep \050and one ID card object\051\056 The toy sheep glows softly\056 \050Maybe flowers blooming\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Tap the sheep\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom in to the sheep \222 audio story plays \050Nina\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Audio ends naturally\054 or player taps outside the object\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom back out to table\056 A second shard is visible on the table\056\nOther shelf objects can be tapped for their ID card text at any point\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 4 \024 Puzzle Piece 2\nWinter 2021\n\nPlayer action\072 Drag second shard to transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 Shard clicks into place\056 Time element advances to Winter 2021\056 The Coca\055Cola bottle and three ID card objects appear on the shelf\056 The bottle glows softly\056 \050Maybe dirty footprints of boots on the floor\054 Christmas decoration\077\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Tap the bottle\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom in to bottle \222 audio story plays \050Mike\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Audio ends or player taps outside\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom out to new perspective\056 Third shard becomes visible\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 5 \024 Puzzle Piece 3\nSummer 2022\n\nPlayer action\072 Drag third shard to transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 Shard clicks into place\056 Time element advances to Summer 2022\056 The croissant plate appears on a table and two ID card objects in a shelf\056 The plate glows softly\056\nPlayer action\072 Tap the plate\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom in \222 audio story plays \050Louise\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Audio ends or player taps outside\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom out to new perspective\056 Fourth shard becomes visible\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 6 \024 Puzzle Piece 4\nSpring 2024\n\nPlayer action\072 Drag fourth shard to transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 Time element advances to Spring 2024\056 The green glass appears on the counter and one ID card object\056 The whole Caf\351 is green and decorated \050St\056 Patrick\047s Day details visible\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Tap the glass\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom in \222 audio story plays \050Paul\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Audio ends or player taps outside\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom out to new perspective\056 Fifth shard becomes visible\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 7 \024 Puzzle Piece 5\nSummer 2026\n\nPlayer action\072 Drag fifth shard to transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 Time element advances to Summer 2026\056 The crossword pencil and two ID card object appear\056 The shelf is now nearly full\054 close to what the player first saw on arrival\056 The pencil glows softly\056\nPlayer action\072 Tap the pencil\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom in \222 audio story plays \050Daniel\051\056\nPlayer action\072 Audio ends or player taps outside\056\nWhat happens\072 Zoom out\056 The sixth and final shard becomes visible\056\nClosing hint\072  Few packing boxes are half visible behind the counter\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 8 \024 Puzzle Piece 6 \046 Return to Now\nAutumn 2026\054 present day\n\nPlayer action\072 Drag sixth shard to transparent figure\056\nWhat happens\072 The figurine is whole\056 The cracks are still faintly visible\056 Time element advances to Autumn 2026\054 today\056 The shelves are full\054 exactly as it was when the player first walked in\056 The coffee cup is empty\056\nAudio\072 The full Caf\351 ambience from the opening returns\054 murmur of people\054 cups\056\nClosing Hint\072 Several objects in the shelves now have small \042Reserved\042 signs on them\056\n\n\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\055\n\nSCENE 9 \024 Leaving\nAutumn 2026\054 present day\n\nPlayer action\077 \072 Tap the door to step outside\056\nWhat the player sees\072 Door opens \222 Transition to outside \050start view\054 Scene 1\051\056\nClosing Hint \024 now clear\072 The poster in the caf\351 window \050from outside or inside\077\051\054 previously unreadable through the rain\054 is now visible\056 \042Last Celebration\056 Join us if you can\056 This Sunday the 14th\056 \024 Maria\042\nAudio\072\050 The bell again as the door opens\056\051\n\nTwo lines of text fade in\072 \042Some places hold people together\056 Maria\047s did\056\042\n)
