  << /ActualText (Object\072 Toy Bear   \174   Customer\072 Nina\n\nI left the bear by accident\056\050I was maybe \056\056\056 six or seven\054 and I really didn\031t want to go to school\056 Every morning\054 Mum would bring me here first for a hot chocolate\056 That was kind of our deal\056\050\050I took that bear everywhere\056 One day\054 I must have just\046 forgotten it\056\050\050 Maria put it on the shelf with a tiny paper cup next to it\056 She said something like\054 \034He stayed for lunch\056\035\050I remember laughing way more than the joke deserved\056\050\050Maria tried to give him back\054 but I told her\054 \034He can stay \046 keep you company while I\031m at school\056\035 So he did\056\050\050Now I come on my own sometimes\056 \050The bear\031s still here\056)
