  << /ActualText (Object\072 Croissant Plate   \174   Customer\072 Louise\n\nThis plate\046 that\031s ours\056 Mine and Lotte\031s\056\050\050We come here every morning\054 like\046 eight o\031clock\056 Same table in the back\056 Two coffees\054 two croissants\056 We always end up ordering the second coffee before we\031ve even finished the first one\056 Maria still laughs at us for that\056\050\050One morning\054 Lotte just didn\031t show up\056  Maria didn\031t ask\056 She just put another croissant on the plate and said\054 \034In case she\031s late\056\035\050\050The next day\054 Maria brought the same plate\056\050She\047s used it for us ever since\056)
