  << /ActualText (Object\072 Green Glass \057 Had   \174   Customer\072 Paul\n\nEvery year on Saint Patrick\031s Day\054 Maria does this thing\046 she turns all the drinks green\056\050Like really\054 really green\056 Coffee\054 hot chocolate\054 lemonade\056 One year\054 she even did green milk foam\056\050\050The first time I saw it\054 I told her it looked like a science experiment\056 She just handed me the glass and said\054 \034Paul\054 you can go first\056\035\050\050People started arguing about which shade of green looks best\054 like it actually matters\046 and suddenly you\031re talking to whoever\031s next to you\056\050\050Last time\054 someone even started singing \056\056\056 not very well\056\050\050I still don\031t know if any of it tastes good\056\050But Maria does it every year \046 \050And I keep showing up for it\056 \057 And somehow\054 it became a tradition\056)
