3131 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Object\072 The Crossword Pencil   \174   Customer\072 Daniel\n\nThat\031s mine or\046 was\054 I guess\054 haha\056\050I think it started three or four months ago\056 I took the wrong bus\054 got off in the rain\054 and came in just to get out of it\056 I ordered a tea\054 so it didn\031t feel weird just sitting there\056\050\050There was a newspaper on the table\056 Half of a crossword already done\056 I told myself I\031d just do one clue\056\056\056 I stayed for two hours\054 maybe even more\056\050\050At some point\054 Maria walked past\054 looked down at it\054 and said\054 \034You missed one\056\035 And she was right\056\050\050After that\054 I started coming back sometimes\056 Not really planning it\056 \050Now\054 when she sees me\054 she\031ll leave a newspaper out\056 She doesn\031t make a thing of it\056\050\050The pencil got shorter over time\056 No one replaced it\056\050And then one day I came in\054 and it was on the shelf\056\050I didn\031t really ask why\056)
